Falsifies `rsext4::entries::verification::directory_entry_parse_is_total`.

The defect: the entry parse no longer checks that the name fits in the slice, so a name length
past the end reads outside it.

Expected to fail: the slice index of the name.

diff --git a/src/entries/iterator.rs b/src/entries/iterator.rs
index e07e7af..29aea3f 100644
--- a/src/entries/iterator.rs
+++ b/src/entries/iterator.rs
@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@ impl<'a> Ext4DirEntryInfo<'a> {
         let name_len = data[6] as usize;
         let file_type = data[7];
 
-        if rec_len < 8 || name_len > 255 || data.len() < 8 + name_len {
+        if rec_len < 8 || name_len > 255 {
             return None;
         }
 
